PLIG-7619 - SPIKE: Household Owner Auto-Assignment Based on Relationship Ownership
Technical Feasibility

The requirement is feasible.

Investigation confirmed:

Household records are stored as Account records with the Household Record Type.
Related Business and Individual Accounts are linked to the Household using CRM_Customer_Household__c.
Households can be identified where all related Accounts are owned by the same user.
Ownership mismatches currently exist and can be corrected automatically.

A monthly Scheduled Batch Apex process is the recommended solution.

