Proposed Solution
Monthly Scheduled Batch Apex
Query all Accounts with CRM_Customer_Household__c populated.
Group Accounts by Household.
Determine distinct Relationship Owners.
If all related Accounts have the same owner:
Compare against the Household Owner.
Update Household Owner when different.
Skip Households with multiple Relationship Owners.
Log any failed updates for troubleshooting.
Processing Logic
Plain Text
IF
Related Account Count > 0
AND Distinct Owner Count = 1
AND Household Owner != Related Account Owner
THEN
Update Household Owner
ELSE
Skip
Business Rules
Update Household Owner When
Household contains one or more related Accounts.
All related Accounts have the same Owner.
Household Owner differs from the common Owner.
Do Not Update When
No related Accounts exist.
Related Accounts have multiple Owners.
Household Owner already matches the common Owner.
Out of Scope
Households with multiple Relationship Owners.
Ownership hierarchy logic.
Manager-based ownership assignment.
Real-time ownership synchronization.
Manual ownership conflict resolution.
